```

```apex
15:52:21:077 EXCEPTION_THROWN [11]|My2Exception: Throw with inner exception
```

```apex
15:52:21:000 FATAL_ERROR AnonymousBlock: line 11, column 1
```

```apex
15:52:21:000 FATAL_ERROR Caused by
```

```apex
